  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to NDC Partnership 2021-2025 Work Program and Partnership Action Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The NDC Partnership - a coalition of countries, international institutions and non-state actors - supports developing countries and emerging markets to accelerate implementation of their climate action plans (NDCs) and related Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs), and to increase ambition, with a view to achieving the Paris Climate Agreement goals. Through NDCP&#x2019;s Country Engagement Strategy, countries receive technical and financial support from partners to achieve these goals. Building on existing support mechanisms, NDCP will support the provision of technical assistance through the Partnership Action Fund. The duration of the activity is budget neutrally extended until 31 December 2026.</narrative>
  </description>
